    <bpmn:process id="W_W2690" name="W2690. Store-Level Regulatory Issue Escalation &amp; Resolution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Store encounters regulatory issue
Frequency: Ad-hoc; ~30–50 issues/month
Volume: ~30–50/month
Owner: Legal Compliance Officer
Participants: Legal Compliance Officer, Store Manager, VP Legal
Source: workflow W2690 — Store-Level Regulatory Issue Escalation &amp; Resolution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2690_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2690_Lane1" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2690_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2690_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2690_Lane2" name="Legal Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2690_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2690_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2690_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2690_Start4" name="Store encounters regulatory issue">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2690_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2690_Task5" name="Store Manager reports the issue within 24 hours: an inspection finding, a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Store Manager reports the issue within 24 hours: an inspection finding, a Notice of Violation, a tax dispute, a DTI consumer complaint (links to W2682), a DOLE labor complaint (links to W2681); provides the initial documentation; Officer logs it in the case-management system
Responsible (R): Store Manager
Accountable (A): Legal Compliance Officer
Duration: Within 24 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2690_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2690_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2690_Task6" name="Officer assesses severity: critical (trade-closure risk) → immediate VP Legal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Officer assesses severity: critical (trade-closure risk) → immediate VP Legal escalation; major (penalty exposure &gt;PHP 100K) → Legal team within 48 hours; minor → Officer handles within 7 days
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer / VP Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Within 24 hours of intake</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2690_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2690_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2690_Task7" name="Officer coordinates the resolution: gathers evidence, prepares the response…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Officer coordinates the resolution: gathers evidence, prepares the response, represents BuildRight in any proceeding, negotiates a settlement where appropriate; documents the outcome; updates the underlying procedure to prevent recurrence
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer / VP Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2690_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2690_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2690_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2690_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-459 (ensure controlled execution — LGU Relationship &amp; Regulatory Analytics (PA-76.3).) | - operational: permit/issue currency tracked in the master; operational: VP Legal review of any settlement &gt;PHP 100K or any trade-suspension outcome
Owner: Legal Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
