    <bpmn:process id="W_W2691" name="W2691. LGU Regulatory Intelligence Network" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly intelligence sharing
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~150 LGUs (per W54)
Owner: Legal Compliance Officer
Participants: Legal Compliance Officer, VP Legal, Industry Peers
Source: workflow W2691 — LGU Regulatory Intelligence Network</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2691_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2691_Lane1" name="Legal Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2691_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2691_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2691_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2691_Lane2" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2691_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2691_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2691_Start4" name="Quarterly intelligence sharing">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2691_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2691_Task5" name="Officer maintains the intelligence network: Philippine Retailers Association…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Officer maintains the intelligence network: Philippine Retailers Association committee participation, a retail peer group (non-competitor informal benchmarking), legal-firm bulletins, and the field intelligence from Regional Managers&#x27; LGU interactions (links to W2680 monitoring)
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Ongoing (~4 hours/week)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2691_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2691_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2691_Task6" name="Officer shares intelligence across BuildRight&#x27;s regions quarterly: a successful…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Officer shares intelligence across BuildRight&#x27;s regions quarterly: a successful practice in one LGU (e.g., a fast-track-permit arrangement) shared for adoption elsewhere; new requirements flagged proactively before they reach BuildRight&#x27;s LGUs
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2691_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2691_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2691_Task7" name="VP Legal incorporates the intelligence into strategy: identifies sector trends…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Legal incorporates the intelligence into strategy: identifies sector trends (environmental requirements, single-use-plastic bans, LGU digitalization), anticipates upcoming requirements, and proactively prepares the stores ahead of enactment
Responsible (R): VP Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2691_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2691_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2691_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2691_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-459 (ensure controlled execution — LGU Relationship &amp; Regulatory Analytics (PA-76.3).) | - CTL-459 (competition-law conduct in peer forums — links to W2683); operational: VP Legal review of any peer-shared practice before BuildRight adoption
Owner: Legal Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
