    <bpmn:process id="W_W2693" name="W2693. Annual Multi-Region Regulatory Compliance Report" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual reporting cycle
Frequency: Annual
Volume: BuildRight group — ~205 locations
Owner: VP Legal
Participants: VP Legal, Legal Compliance Officer, CFO, CEO
Source: workflow W2693 — Annual Multi-Region Regulatory Compliance Report</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2693_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2693_Lane1" name="Legal Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2693_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2693_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2693_Lane2" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2693_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2693_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2693_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2693_Start4" name="Annual reporting cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2693_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2693_Task5" name="Legal Compliance Officer compiles the annual dataset: compliance rate by region…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal Compliance Officer compiles the annual dataset: compliance rate by region and LGU, total regulatory cost (from W2687), inspections and findings (from W2688), consumer complaints (from W2682), DOLE results (from W2681), BIR CAS status (from W2685), permit summary (from the W2677 dashboard)
Responsible (R): Legal Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2693_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2693_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2693_Task6" name="VP Legal adds the strategic analysis: risk assessment by region, emerging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Legal adds the strategic analysis: risk assessment by region, emerging regulatory trends (from W2691), relationship quality (from W2686), recommended investments, staffing needs
Responsible (R): VP Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2693_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2693_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2693_Task7" name="VP Legal presents to the CEO and the Board Audit Committee (links to VS-21 /…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Legal presents to the CEO and the Board Audit Committee (links to VS-21 / W120 audit, VS-36 governance): overall compliance posture, key risks, remediation plans, budget requests; the report becomes the annual governance documentation retained per VS-88
Responsible (R): VP Legal
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2693_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2693_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2693_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2693_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-304 (board governance &amp; MCG compliance audit — links to VS-21); operational: Board Audit Committee receipt of the report minuted (governance trail)
Owner: VP Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2693_Assoc10" sourceRef="W2693_Annotation9" targetRef="W2693_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
